  "title": {
    "zh": "安装集群组件",
    "en": "InstallClusterAddons"
  },
  "descriptions": {
    "zh": "- 单用户调用频率： 10次/秒。\n- 创建集群是一个异步的操作，调用接口返回之后，需要等待10~20分钟不等，等待集群初始化完成。这个过程中可以调用DescribeClustersV1接口查询集群创建状态。集群创建成功之后，可以调用DescribeClusterUserKubeconfig获取集群证书。",
    "en": "- The call frequency for a single user is limited to 10 calls per second.\n\n- Cluster creation is an asynchronous operation. After the API call returns, the cluster requires 10 to 20 minutes to complete initialization. During this process, you can call the DescribeClustersV1 operation to query the cluster creation status. After the cluster is created, you can call the DescribeClusterUserKubeconfig operation to obtain the cluster certificate."
  },
  "example": {
    "unifiedCli": "aliyun ens install-cluster-addons --cluster-id eck-xxxxxxxx --addons '[{\"Version\":\"v1\",\"ConfigSchema\":[{\"AppVersion\":\"859e9d595b2974ed79c444658d1dea89\",\"ConfigVersion\":\"4155709cd12a09bdb8cbaca71bf03233\",\"Params\":{\"k1\":\"v1\"},\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}],\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}]' --region cn-hangzhou",
    "legacyCli": "aliyun ens InstallClusterAddons --region cn-hangzhou --ClusterId 'eck-xxxxxxxx' --Addons '[{\"Version\":\"v1\",\"ConfigSchema\":[{\"AppVersion\":\"859e9d595b2974ed79c444658d1dea89\",\"ConfigVersion\":\"4155709cd12a09bdb8cbaca71bf03233\",\"Params\":{\"k1\":\"v1\"},\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}],\"Name\":\"edge-csi-lite\"}]'"
  }
